        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi akamwambia Ahimeleki, kuhani, Mfalme ameniagiza shughuli, akaniambia, Asijue mtu awaye yote habari ya shughuli hii ninayokutuma, wala ya neno hili ninalokuamuru; nami nimewaagiza vijana waende mahali fulani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna nini basi, chini ya mkono wako? Nipe mkononi mwangu mikate mitano, au chochote ulicho nacho hapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
